{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>[The game is still in development, and some visuals are subject to change.]</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Gloops</strong>, astonishing aquatic creatures from outer space, and <strong>create</strong> the perfect environment for their well-being.\u00a0Fill up your <strong>encyclopedia</strong> and complete a variety of <strong>missions</strong>\u00a0to earn your <strong>Gloopology</strong> diploma!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/6961fca174d3889053672773931c2878.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Catch the Gloops!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your trusty <i>Gloop Catcher 2000\u2122 </i>remote\u00a0fishing device, select a destination planet and catch unique Gloops and environments to expand your collection. Make sure to visit each planet during <strong>cosmic events</strong>, as you may find rare and <strong>shiny</strong> Gloops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/467d69a399b338e5ac1e678b661bee2a.poster.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/467d69a399b338e5ac1e678b661bee2a.webm?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/467d69a399b338e5ac1e678b661bee2a.mp4?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Study and care for your Gloops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place them in different tanks and\u00a0<strong>adjust</strong> their ecosystems. <strong>Experiment</strong> to uncover their preferences and complete your encyclopedia with your <strong>discoveries</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/eb799c69ce07aa953212af020288435a.poster.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/eb799c69ce07aa953212af020288435a.webm?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/eb799c69ce07aa953212af020288435a.mp4?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Earn Research Points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome <strong>Scientists</strong> from all over the galaxy aboard your research station, and <strong>earn research points</strong> based on how many discoveries you made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/deb67400255ca019c8b986120256d070.poster.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/deb67400255ca019c8b986120256d070.webm?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/deb67400255ca019c8b986120256d070.mp4?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>Customize your space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place</strong> everything you catch exactly where you want to inside your 3D aquariums. Adjust the <strong>color theme</strong> and voil\u00e0! An expertly designed research base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/36872a79ef0fa6d7c4af053473d8ce06.poster.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/36872a79ef0fa6d7c4af053473d8ce06.webm?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/36872a79ef0fa6d7c4af053473d8ce06.mp4?t=1772720225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/803f5bbe58aaab2fbd9cbe6fed416021.avif?t=1772720225\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 missions to earn your Gloopology diploma</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 to 5 hours of gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Gloops to collect</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes and decorations to customize your aquarium</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fun and relaxing universe in outer space</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A somewhat helpful robo-cat assistant...\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496970?t=1772720225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/3ee8345868188f470142076ae566db601b90068d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772720225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto